  "solution": {
    "text": "Electric potential at centre $R=0$\r\n$$\r\nV_{\\text {centre }}=1.5 V_{\\text {surface }}\r\n$$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/JPf3SXkOJwUq0wKVWyoOTmYpnxkuFO7gQ3A73DV-j_8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\nwhere,\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nV_0 & =\\frac{k Q}{R} \\\\\r\nV_{\\text {inside }} & =\\frac{k Q}{2 R}\\left(3-\\frac{r^2}{R^2}\\right)\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/YwEC8mM2hhxQSxrBswndzaLb6UKhFu6vRLWqOXkmnrU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
